 1774                     ;
 1775                     ; ALL "RESERVED" WORDS ARE TRANSLATED INTO SINGLE
 1776                     ; BYTES WITH THE MSB ON. THIS SAVES SPACE AND TIME
 1777                     ; BY ALLOWING FOR TABLE DISPATCH DURING EXECUTION.
 1778                     ; THEREFORE ALL STATEMENTS APPEAR TOGETHER IN THE
 1779                     ; RESERVED WORD LIST IN THE SAME ORDER THEY
 1780                     ; APPEAR IN STMDSP.
