 1868                     ;
 1869                     ; FNDLIN SEARCHES THE PROGRAM TEXT FOR THE LINE
 1870                     ; WHOSE NUMBER IS PASSED IN "LINNUM".
 1871                     ; THERE ARE TWO POSSIBLE RETURNS:
 1872                     ;
 1873                     ;	1) CARRY SET.
 1874                     ;	   LOWTR POINTS TO THE LINK FIELD IN THE LINE
 1875                     ;	   WHICH IS THE ONE SEARCHED FOR.
 1876                     ;
 1877                     ;	2) CARRY NOT SET.
 1878                     ;	   LINE NOT FOUND. [LOWTR] POINTS TO THE LINE IN THE
 1879                     ;	   PROGRAM GREATER THAN THE ONE SOUGHT AFTER.
 1880                     ;
