 2371                     ;
 2372                     ; A GOSUB ENTRY ON THE STACK HAS THE FOLLOWING FORMAT:
 2373                     ;
 2374                     ; LOW ADDRESS:
 2375                     ;	THE GOSUTK ONE BYTE
 2376                     ;	THE LINE NUMBER OF THE GOSUB STATEMENT TWO BYTES
 2377                     ;	A POINTER INTO THE TEXT OF THE GOSUB TWO BYTES
