       D819  85 BA
 2435  D81B  20 29 D8     DATA:	JSR	DATAN		;SKIP TO END OF STATEMENT,
 2436                     				;SINCE WHEN "GOSUB" STUCK THE TEXT  PNTR
 2437                     				;ONTO THE STACK, THE LINE NUMBER ARG
