 3601                     SUBTTL	DIMENSION AND VARIABLE SEARCHING.
 3602                     ;
 3603                     ; THE "DIM" CODE SETS [DIMFLG] AND THEN FALLS INTO THE VARIABLE SEARCH
 3604                     ; ROUTINE, WHICH LOOKS AT DIMFLG AT THREE DIFFERENT POINTS.
 3605                     ;	1) IF AN ENTRY IS FOUND, "DIMFLG" BEING ON INDICATES
 3606                     ;		A "DOUBLY" DIMENSIONED VARIABLE.
 3607                     ;	2) WHEN A NEW ENTRY IS BEING BUILT "DIMFLG" BEING ON
 3608                     ;		INDICTAES THE INDICES SHOULD BE USED FOR THE
 3609                     ;		SIZE OF EACH INDEX. OTHERWISE THE DEFAULT OF TEN
 3610                     ;		IS USED.
 3611                     ;	3) WHEN THE BUILD ENTRY CODE FINISHES, ONLY IF "DIMFLG" IS OFF
 3612                     ;		WILL INDEXING BE DONE.
 3613                     ;
 3614  DE69  20 57 DD     DIM3:	JSR	CHKCOM		;MUST BE A COMMA
 3615  DE6C  AA           DIM:	TAX			;SET [ACCX] NONZERO.
 3616                     				;[ACCA] MUST BE NONZERO TO WORK RIGHT.
 3617  DE6D  20 7B DE     DIM1:	JSR	PTRGT1
 3618  DE70  20 B8 00     DIMCON: JSR	CHRGOT		;GET LAST CHARACTER.
 3619  DE73  D0 F4        	BNE	DIM3
 3620  DE75  60           	RTS
 3621                     ;
 3622                     ; ROUTINE TO READ THE VARIABLE NAME AT THE CURRENT TEXT POSITION
 3623                     ; AND  PUT A POINTER TO ITS VALUE IN VARPNT. [TXTPTR]
 3624                     ; POINTS TO THE TERMINATING CHARCTER.. NOT THAT EVALUATING SUBSCRIPTS
 3625                     ; IN A VARIABLE NAME CAN CAUSE RECURSIVE CALLS TO "PTRGET" SO AT
 3626                     ; THAT POINT ALL VALUES MUST BE STORED ON THE STACK.
 3627                     ;
 3628  DE76  A2 00        PTRGET: LDXI	0		;MAKE [ACCX]=0.
 3629  DE78  20 B8 00     	JSR	CHRGOT		;RETRIEVE LAST CHARACTER.
 3630  DE7B  86 10        PTRGT1: STX	DIMFLG		;STORE FLAG AWAY.
 3631  DE7D  85 84        PTRGT2: STA	VARNAM
