 3900                     ;
 3901                     ; HERE WHEN VARIABLE IS NOT FOUND IN THE ARRAY TABLE.
 3902                     ;
 3903                     ; BUILDING AN ENTRY.
 3904                     ;
 3905                     ;	PUT DOWN THE DESCRIPTOR.
 3906                     ;	SETUP NUMBER OF DIMENSIONS.
 3907                     ;	MAKE SURE THERE IS ROOM FOR THE NEW ENTRY.
 3908                     ;	REMEMBER "VARPNT".
 3909                     ;	TALLY=4.
 3910                     ;	SKIP 2 LOCS FOR LATER FILL IN OF SIZE.
 3911                     ; LOOP: GET AN INDICE
 3912                     ;	PUT DOWN NUMBER+1 AND INCREMENT VARPTR.
 3913                     ;	TALLY=TALLY*NUMBER+1.
 3914                     ;	DECREMENT NUMBER-DIMS.
 3915                     ;	BNE LOOP
 3916                     ;	CALL "REASON" WITH [Y,A] REFLECTING LAST LOC OF VARIABLE.
 3917                     ;	UPDATE STREND.
 3918                     ;	ZERO ALL.
 3919                     ;	MAKE TALLY INCLUDE MAXDIMS AND DESCRIPTOR.
 3920                     ;	PUT DOWN TALLY.
 3921                     ;	IF CALLED BY DIMENSION, RETURN.
 3922                     ;	OTHERWISE INDEX INTO THE VARIABLE AS IF IT
 3923                     ;	 WERE FOUND ON THE INITIAL SEARCH.
 3924                     ;
