 4578                     ;
 4579                     ; "FRETMP" IS PASSED A STRING DESCRIPTOR PNTR IN [Y,A].
 4580                     ; A CHECK IS MADE TO SEE IF THE STRING DESCRIPTOR POINTS TO THE LAST
 4581                     ; TEMPORARY DESCRIPTOR ALLOCATED BY PUTNEW.
 4582                     ; IF SO, THE TEMPORARY IS FREED UP BY THE UPDATING OF [TEMPPT].
 4583                     ; IF A TEMP IS FREED UP, A FURTHER CHECK SEES IF THE STRING DATA THAT
 4584                     ; THAT STRING TEMP PNT'D TO IS THE LOWEST PART OF STRING SPACE IN USE.
 4585                     ; IF SO, [FRETOP] IS UPDATED TO REFLECT THE FACT THE FACT THAT THE SPACE
 4586                     ; IS NO LONGER IN USE.
 4587                     ; THE ADDR OF THE ACTUAL STRING IS RETURNED IN [Y,X] AND
 4588                     ; ITS LENGTH IN ACCA.
 4589                     ;
 4590  E473  20 02 DC     FRESTR: JSR	CHKSTR		;MAKE SURE ITS A STRING.
 4591  E476  A5 A3 A4 A4  FREFAC: LDWD	FACMO		;FREE UP STR PNT'D TO BY FAC.
 4592  E47A  85 61 84 62  FRETMP: STWD	INDEX		;GET LENGTH FOR LATER.
 4593  E47E  20 AB E4     	JSR	FRETMS		;FREE UP THE TEMPORARY DESC.
 4594  E481  08           	PHP			;SAVE CODES.
 4595  E482  A0 00        	LDYI	0		;PREP TO GET STUFF.
